  "label": "Cultural hierarchy joke",
  "description": "The meme uses a visual contrast (modern food vs. historical portrait) to create a comedic effect by suggesting that Romanian cuisine is more 'traditional' or 'exotic' than American food. This relies on a real-world concept of cultural hierarchy, where one culture is implicitly deemed more sophisticated or authentic than another, which can be seen as culturally insensitive or potentially harmful.",
